    "product_faq_iXcLnC": {
      "type": "product-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_Fq7LBp": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product"
          }
        },
        "tab_content_683zbz": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>What devices are compatible with this 3-in-1 charging station power bank?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>It is designed for the Apple ecosystem and works with iPhone 17/16/15/14/13/12 series, Apple Watch Ultra 2/Ultra/Series 10–4, and AirPods 4/3/2/Pro/Pro 2, allowing you to charge all your essential devices in one place.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_fjWWzA": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>How much battery capacity does it provide?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>The 10,000mAh battery can charge iPhone 16 Pro up to 1.8 times, Apple Watch Series 9 about 17–20 times, or AirPods Pro about 10–12 times, making it ideal for travel or short trips.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_Wrb3qd": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Does it support fast charging?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. With PD 20W fast charging, your iPhone 16 Pro can reach 56% in just 30 minutes. The power bank itself can be fully recharged in about 3.5 hours via the USB-C port.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_KQRxtY": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Can it charge multiple devices at the same time?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Yes. It can charge iPhone, Apple Watch, and AirPods simultaneously, and fully power all three devices in about 2–3 hours. <br/>Note: The product does not support charging four devices at once.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        },
        "tab_content_NVT3iN": {
          "type": "tab-content",
          "settings": {
            "tab-name": "Product",
            "collapsible-title": "<strong>Is it safe and convenient for travel?</strong>",
            "collapsible-content": "<p>Absolutely. The foldable MagSafe design keeps it compact and travel-friendly. It also features a Hall effect magnetic switch and smart protection chips to prevent overheating, overcharging, and short circuits for safe charging.</p>",
            "isactive": false
          }
        }
      },
